 - 2026-06-17: PHASE A1 (HEADLINE; convert the PROVEN moat into a generation GAIN) -- S3 STRATIFIED VERIFIER-GUIDED DENOISING SEARCH (arXiv:2604.06260 VERIFIED) using the .401 LEAK-ROBUST scorer. .401 PROVED the in-generation oracle-distinct moat exists (exp4338, leak-robust, replicated, CI95-excl-0) -- but a proven moat is a MEASUREMENT; the north-star §5 win condition is UTILITY: the verifier earns its place when it makes generation MORE ACCURATE AT EQUAL COMPUTE (Pareto-improve the base generator). S3 (Stratified Scaling Search, 2604.06260) is the instrument: at each DiffusionGemma denoising step, expand K candidate partial states, score them with the leak-robust exp4337 scorer (the in-loop verifier), resample the promising ones while preserving frontier diversity -> a reward-tilted sampling distribution anchored to the model prior. The DECISIVE test is at a FIXED NFE (denoising compute) budget: does S3-Carnot beat (a) best-of-K@matched-NFE (the same compute spent on K independent samples + final selection -- the must-beat compute-matched baseline), (b) unguided single-pass, and (c) self-reward SMC (2602.01849, the model's INTRINSIC confidence -- the sharpest oracle-distinct test)? Reuse the .401 skeptic-proof harness: the no-op DEGENERATE_CONTROLS guard (controls_differentiated) + an INDEPENDENT leak re-check on the scorer. Emit s3_guided_beats_control BARE bool := (S3-Carnot - best-of-K@NFE > 0 AND its CI95 excludes 0 AND controls_differentiated AND S3-Carnot - self-reward-SMC > 0) at FIXED NFE, n>=80, >=3 seeds. verifier_is_oracle=false. A win = the moat graduates 'exists'->'useful' (Pareto-improves generation). An honest null (the proven scorer does NOT convert to a fixed-NFE generation gain) is decision-grade. NO TRAINING (test-time search only); NO TRM training; DiffusionGemma via the llama.cpp PR binary. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=controls_not_differentiable; results/experiment_4348_s3_stratified_verifier_guided_search.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE B1 (ARC NORTH STAR; operator MANDATORY 2026-06-17) -- E3 ka59 -> L1 with EXPLORE-VERIFY-PLAN, more refactor rounds in a quieter codex window. ka59 is the CLOSEST still-partial deep-tail game: .401 (exp4340) reached verifier_best_accuracy 0.56 with explore-verify-plan but did NOT reproduce L1. Continue the SAME upgraded harness (AERA explore-verify-plan arXiv:2605.25931 -- EXPLORE collects verifier-gated transition lemmas, PLAN only after the model passes mechanic checks; Agent2World adaptive world-model testing arXiv:2512.22336 -- adaptive unit tests surface the hidden-rule gap) with MORE refactor rounds and the higher-accuracy ar25/sc25 world models as shape templates. The codex agent IS the proposer (WRITES results/arc_e3/ka59/world_model.py; NO nested CodexProposer). INCREMENTAL-PROGRESS scoped: +1 level (L1). HARD gate: offline_reproduced=true AND reproduced_levels>=1 (arc_solver_kit.reproduce). An honest partial (best verifier_accuracy + the residual mismatch CLASS as a missing-world-model-rule gap in ops/verifier_gaps.md) is PROGRESS. verifier_is_oracle=true (execution-grounded ARC progress, NOT an oracle-distinct moat). NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission; run when codex is NOT saturated; cap per-task wall-time. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success_e3_ka59_L1_reproduced; results/experiment_4350_e3_explore_verify_plan_ka59.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE B2 (ARC NORTH STAR; operator MANDATORY 2026-06-17; biggest reproducible-level upside) -- E3 DEEPER on the CRACKED games: sc25 L2+ (the single biggest upside, +4) + ar25 L2 + tn36 L7, +1 each per Incremental-Progress Scoping. .401 reproduced sc25 L1 (exp4341, the spell-cast/cast-grid mechanic) and ar25 L1 (exp4339); sc25 has 5 LIVE-RECORDED levels (only L1 reproduced -> reproducing L2..L5 is +4 reproducible levels), and the registry notes tn36 L7 (obj 41,28 -> tgt 41,8) is a maze the current multi-run planner does not yet crack. EXTEND the existing world models (results/arc_e3/{{sc25,ar25}}/world_model.py) and the tn36 program-editor solver (scripts/arc3_tn36_offline_solver.py) to the next level(s) via the SAME explore-verify-plan harness (AERA 2605.25931 + Agent2World 2512.22336). LOOP the three targets with a per-target checkpoint + hard per-target wall-time cap (breadth-of-progress beats all-or-nothing). The codex agent IS the proposer (NO nested CodexProposer). HARD gate per target: a NEW level offline_reproduced=true beyond the prior reproduced best. Report a per-target scorecard + the new reproducible_total_levels. An honest partial per target (best verifier_accuracy + the residual win-mechanic gap CLASS) is PROGRESS. verifier_is_oracle=true (execution-grounded). NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission; checkpoint after EACH target. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success_e3_deeper_tn36_reproduced; results/experiment_4351_e3_deeper_solved_games.json
